      {
        "text": "Vinh T. Ngo was elected to the Monterey Park City Council in 2022. He has served as mayor. He is a managing director and risk executive for commercial real estate at Bank of America. He served on the Garvey School District Board from 2017 to 2022 and continues as president of the Garvey Education Foundation.",
